      "semantic_baseline": "Lecture physical PDF p. 15: the downward curve is marginal net private benefit ($MNPB=MPB-MPC$), the upward curve is MEC. At zero activity, the diagram normalizes welfare to zero. At unrestricted $Q_{max}$, private net benefit is $A+B+C$ and damage is $B+C+D$, giving $A-D$. At $Q_{optimum}$, private net benefit is $A+B$, damage is $B$, and welfare is $A$. The increase from restriction is $D$, while $B$ remains as optimal damage.* Lecture, physical PDF pp. 15,25",
      "change_class": "new_content",
      "previous_path": null,
      "previous_hash": null,
      "affected_objective_ids": [
        "O005",
        "O006",
        "O007"
